        },
        "title": "Description and rationale",
        "body": "Say what this class is in a sentence or two, in the words of someone deciding whether to use it. The one-line meaning at the top of the page comes from the Meaning property; this is the fuller version.\n\nThen say why it exists: what it holds that an existing class does not.",
